# Front door (docs/WEBSITE.md §routing): the marketing site owns the root — the bare
# domain 302s to /welcome/ (redirects outrank static assets on Cloudflare Pages, so this
# wins over dist/index.html). The GAME lives at /play — no asset exists there, so the
# SPA fallback below serves the app shell. 302 (not 301) so the front door stays
# reversible; flip to 301 once the layout is settled.
/    /welcome/    302

# SPA fallback: serve the app shell for any non-asset path (200 rewrite — existing
# static assets shadow it), so /play and client-side routes resolve correctly.
/*    /index.html    200
